        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Greetings, Welcome to Bree. If your looking for a place to stay I would hurry along to the Prancing Pony. Be wary not to be outside after nightfall. It isn't to safe these days."
          }
        }
      },
