        "Text": {
          "type": "cexolocstring",
          "value": {
            "0": "Aye, now ye mention it. Bill Ferny's been seen skulking about his old house down the way -- but Ferny himself's been in the market all the while, plain as day. A man can't skulk in two places at once, can he? The watch is stretched thin as it is. If ye've a mind, go knock on that door and see who answers."
          }
        }
      },
